From 0883b58c44a07cbc18fb7a70536d81779ced2942 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rosetta <cole@phosphor.co>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 22:38:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(compaction): classify builtin command before attribution

- Preserve the authenticated structured /compact intent through host-daemon speaker presentation so provider bridges invoke their existing compaction path instead of generating prose.
- Keep persisted human attribution intact while raw, quoted, attachment-bearing, agent-authored, plugin-origin, and other slash inputs remain ordinary.
- Prove the full public send-to-bridge path with the scripted provider and a negative input table.
